# In Upcoming, ] on an entry starting tomorrow moves it to the next day's group with the focus, and } on it later leaves the start date alone.
file <<END
Work:
	- Review PRs @start({today+1})
	- Write report @due({today+3})
END
keys gU
see Tomorrow · 
keys ]
hide Tomorrow · 
keys }
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Review PRs @start({today+2}) @due({today+1})
	- Write report @due({today+3})
END
